Sorting + Heap: Time - O(1), Space - O(n)
    - Sort the meeting intervals based on their start time and create a heap (priority queue) to store the meeting end times.
    - Iterate over the intervals and check (meeting.starttime >= previous-meeting endtime)
    - If true, reuse the meeting room, else add the meeting end time to heap.
    - finally return the no of meeting rooms required by returning the heap size.